# generated site
# The builders are tracked, the pages they emit are not: 60 MB of HTML carrying
# embedded base64 point clouds (bus_stop 12.7 MB, tuner 12.3 MB), rebuilt on every
# run, so each rebuild would add that much to history permanently. Regenerate with
# build_object_page.py / build_results_page.py from outputs/ and data/.
site/

# ...but the chapter 5 figures ARE kept, despite the figures/ and *.png rules above.
# They are small (18-140 KB), they are what the thesis cites, and build_thesis_figures.py
# builds them from the tracked workbook - being ignored by a rule meant for large
# intermediate renders is an accident, not a decision.
!docs/figures/
!docs/figures/*.pdf
!docs/figures/*.png
